If a patient has a potentially-hazardous-job and the patient receives an opioid then every clinician should assess a safe-hazardous-task-performance-ability for the patient.
If a patient has a potentially-hazardous-job and the patient receives a sleep-impairing-medication then every clinician should assess a safe-hazardous-task-performance-ability for the patient.
If a patient has a potentially-hazardous-job and the patient receives a cognition-impairing-medication then every clinician should assess a safe-hazardous-task-performance-ability for the patient.
If a patient has a potentially-hazardous-job and the patient receives a balance-impairing-medication then every clinician should assess a safe-hazardous-task-performance-ability for the patient.
If a patient has a potentially-hazardous-job and the patient receives a coordination-impairing-medication then every clinician should assess a safe-hazardous-task-performance-ability for the patient.
A potentially-hazardous-task-example includes a driving-example and includes a heavy-equipment-use-example and includes a ladder-climbing-example and includes a height-work-example and includes a moving-machinery-work-example and includes a high-voltage-equipment-work-example.
